# TypeScript / React

- Follow existing patterns in nearby files (imports, component structure, hooks).
- Use TypeScript types from `src/types/` and domain helpers from `src/lib/` instead of duplicating shapes.
- ESLint flat config is `eslint.config.js` (recommended TS + React Hooks + React Refresh for Vite).
- Prefer functional components; match formatting and naming already used in `src/components/`.
- For content-driven UI, read from `src/content/` and config from `src/lib/siteConfig.ts` rather than hardcoding site-wide labels.
